   1021  f18b							; --- Call bank1 for 13+2 HUD rendering via fold-pad at $FC68 ---
   1022  f18b							; The fold-pad at $FC68 has identical bytes in bank0 and bank1:
   1023  f18b							;   $FC68: lda #1 / sta $1FF7 / jmp $F540
   1024  f18b							; After sta $1FF7, CPU reads next instruction from bank1 at $FC6D.
   1025  f18b							; Bank1's $FC6D has the same jmp $F540 → seamless bank switch.
   1026  f18b		       4c 68 fc 	      jmp	$FC68	; jump to fold-pad (switches to bank1, runs MenuMain)
