   1111  f1fb							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1112  f1fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1113  f1fb							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1114  f1fb							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
