   1232  f291							;     Hover is set, pin Y (vy=0, no fall) but let the jet ramp run; once thrust
   1233  f291							;     can beat gravity (JetPower >= GRAVITY+1) clear it and normal physics
   1234  f291							;     resumes (he lifts off). No Up -> hovers in place.
