   1986  f5e9							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   1987  f5e9							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   1988  f5e9							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   1989  f5e9							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   1990  f5e9							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   1991  f5e9							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   1992  f5e9							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   1993  f5e9							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   1994  f5e9							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   1995  f5e9							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   1996  f5e9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
