   2047  f619							; ($E2-$E4) is left holding score-pointer bytes, and any enemy drawn then
   2048  f619							; jumps to a garbage Y (user report 2026-10-18: the raft "moved up to the
   2049  f619							; middle of the screen" the moment the points counting started).
