   2439  f812							; Slot1Hook — called from the .Row setup (X = RowIdx = band). Swaps the live
   2440  f812							; trio when slot 1 lives in this band, then repositions P1 and strobes HMOVE
   2441  f812							; on the following line's HBLANK. Preserves X (RowIdx) and Y (running-Y: the
   2442  f812							; .Line loop relies on it being untouched between rows).
