   3376  fc8a							; lands on $F8/$F9 (stack-only cells) on every death path.
   3377  fc8a							; The old post-code (vy/JetPower zeros + rts) was unreachable; DELETED
   3378  fc8a							; 2026-10-16 (intro music) — the $FDD8 blast-tramp pin below absorbs the
   3379  fc8a							; shift, so the twins stay put. DropArm zeroes vyLo/vyHi/PlayerYSub itself
