   3817  fe90							; ObjColorTab — per-scanline GRP1 object colors, stride 8 = ObjSprites
   3818  fe90							; stride; indexed by the same X = ObjBase + r in .Grp1 at $FE00 (4c, same
   3819  fe90							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
   3820  fe90							; per OBJ_* slot: type color x8 (matches EnemyColorTable /
   3821  fe90							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   3822  fe90							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
